{"text": "Soapy moved restlessly on his bench in Madison Square, for winter was coming to New York. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A dead leaf fell into his lap, and Soapy knew it was the card of Jack Frost. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jack Frost was kind to the people who lived in the park, for he always sent a warning before his yearly visit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy knew that the time had come for him to make his plans for the hard winter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy did not dream of a trip to the warm Mediterranean Sea or the sunny southern skies. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All he wanted was three months on the Island, where he would have food, a bed, and good company. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he were in prison for the winter, he would not have to fear the cold wind or the police. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Many kind groups in the city gave beds and food to the poor, but Soapy did not want their charity. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In return for a bed, they asked many questions about his private life, which hurt his pride. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy decided that the law was kinder than charity, so he would let the law take care of him.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "o", "a", "p", "y", " ", "m", "o", "v", "e", "d", " ", "r", "e", "s", "t", "l", "e", "s", "s", "l", "y", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "b", "e", "n", "c", "h", " ", "i", "n", " ", "M", "a", "d", "i", "s", "o", "n", " ", "S", "q", "u", "a", "r", "e", ",", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "w", "i", "n", "t", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "o", "m", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "N", "e", "w", " ", "Y", "o", "r", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", " ", "d", "e", "a", "d", " ", "l", "e", "a", "f", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "l", "a", "p", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "S", "o", "a", "p", "y", " ", "k", "n", "e", "w", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s"